# macOS
.DS_Store

# Internal THC planning notes — keep OUT of the public docs repo
_THC-*.md

# Derived PDF text sidecars belong in the container's .claude/spapi-index/, never in this repo
.claude/spapi-index/
spapi-index/

# --- estate git-hygiene block (added 2026-08-22, estate-wide uncommitted-changes audit) ---
# WHY: .claude/state/ held live client advertising data (Sales/ROAS/Spend) in a repo with a
# public-facing remote; .claude/worktrees/ are LIVE git worktrees whose commit would record
# broken mode-160000 gitlinks with no .gitmodules. Both were tracked in ZERO repos, so this
# block is purely additive. The *.bak-* form is required: git globs are end-anchored, so the
# common `*.bak` never matches `PROJECT-LEDGER.md.bak-xq`.
# A pattern containing a mid-string slash is ANCHORED to this .gitignore's directory, so
# `.claude/state/` matched ONLY the repo-root copy. Measured 2026-08-22: 61 dirty entries were
# nested `.claude/` dirs (specs/.claude/, slate-server-code/.claude/) created by tools resolving
# `.claude/state` against CWD instead of the repo root. `**/` matches at any depth.
.claude/state/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scratch/
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/state/
**/.claude/worktrees/
**/.claude/scratch/
**/.claude/settings.local.json
*.pre-*-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]
*.bak-*
*.idlock
.preview/
# --- end estate git-hygiene block ---
